{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-leanstock-defense",
    "name": "LeanStock Defense",
    "description": "# Импорт\n1. Import этот файл + `LeanStock-Defense.postman_environment.json`\n2. Выбрать environment **LeanStock Defense**\n3. `npm run seed` → обновить tenantId, shopId, productId в environment\n4. `npm run dev` + Redis\n\n# На защите\nОткрывайте папку **DEFENSE — порядок кликов** сверху вниз.\n\nПароль demo: `Defense123!`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "DEFENSE — порядок кликов",
      "description": "Нажимайте запросы по порядку 01 → 14 на защите.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Login Manager",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && j.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', j.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', j.refreshToken);",
                  "  pm.test('Tokens saved', () => pm.expect(j.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{managerPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03 Me",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me" }
        },
        {
          "name": "04 Create Product",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.id) pm.environment.set('productId', String(j.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
